## The Game

**Name:** Blood and Purpose  
**Former name:** Path of the Unknown (still used in GitHub repo URL — not yet renamed)  
**Genre:** Dark fantasy tabletop RPG  
**System:** Classless, skill-based. No pre-defined classes or archetypes. Players invest XP into skills and characteristics to build any hero they want. You are what you do, not what you were born as.  
**Tone:** Dark, deliberate, consequential. The world does not care about the player characters. Violence has weight. Magic has cost. Every scar has a reason.  
**GitHub:** https://github.com/pflastpr-rpg/Path-of-the-Unknown  
**Status:** Active development — targeting Kickstarter

