## The Six Characteristics

Each characteristic governs exactly **6 primary skills** — this is a hard rule, never violated.

| Characteristic | Skills |
|---|---|
| **Agility** | Athletics, Evasion, Quickness, Stealth, Thieving, Tumble |
| **Awareness** | Acute Senses, Druidism, Focus, Precise Strike, Riposte, Stamina |
| **Charisma** | Authority, Charm, Faith, Inspire, Light-Soul, Mending |
| **Intellect** | Evaluate, Knowledge, Perception, Read/Write, Tracker, Wizardry |
| **Physique** | Fortitude, Hard as Nails, Ki, Rugged, Shieldsman, Strength Conditioning |
| **Willpower** | Discipline, Iron Will, Resolve, Shaman, Spirit, Survival |

**Power of Three:** Every primary skill grants +1 to its governing characteristic per 3 points invested. This is universal — no exceptions.

