## Primary Skills — Key Details

### Tiered Skills (have milestone unlocks at 3, 6, 9 points)
All primary skills now have tiered benefits. Key ones to know:

- **Tumble** — 3pt: Emergency Roll (AoE dodge), 6pt: Sure Footing (no prone from falls), 9pt: Death Roll (survive 0 wounds once/encounter)
- **Riposte** — 3pt: +Awareness modifier bonus wounds, 6pt: 2d10 damage, 9pt: triggers on any miss (not just nat 1)
- **Evasion** — 3pt: Dodge reaction 1AP once/encounter, 6pt: half AoE wounds, 9pt: half spell wounds on reaction
- **Stealth** — 3pt: Vanish mid-combat (Advantage test), 6pt: Shadow Step 10ft, 9pt: Ghost Strike (attack without breaking stealth)
- **Hard as Nails** — passive: +2 wounds/pt, +1 physical WM per 2pts. 3pt: spell/blessing WM = floor(pts/2). 6pt: Bloody Minded (ignore Bleeding 1 turn/encounter)
- **Fortitude** — 6pt: ignore first Stunned/encounter, 9pt: remain at 10% wounds instead of 0 once/session
- **Discipline** — 3pt: immune to Shaken, 6pt: +2 to Fear tests, 9pt: cast TN6 or lower spell free once/encounter
- **Resolve** — 3pt: remove Shaken as free action, 6pt: +2 vs Charm/Dominate, 9pt: share Resist bonus with adjacent ally

### Key Skill Notes
- **Counter** was renamed **Riposte** and moved from Agility to **Awareness**
- **Enraged** was removed — fury/berserker is now in Advanced Masteries (Battle-Ready/Berserker)
- **Tumble** is new — added to Agility. XP costs: Halfling 15, Elf 20, Human 25, Dwarf 30
- **Light-Soul** has **no prerequisite** — removed Faith(1) requirement intentionally. Any devoted warrior can take it.
- **Shieldsman** stays in Physique (was considered for Advanced but kept as primary)

