## The Six Magic Disciplines

| Discipline | Characteristic | Spells | Cantrips | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Faith (Theology)** | Charisma | 47 | 5 | Called "Theology" in UI vocation checkbox |
| **Druid** | Awareness | 45 | 5 | Nature magic, resurrection via Regrowth (TN15) |
| **Shaman** | Willpower | 55 | 5 | Spirit/ancestor magic |
| **Wizardry** | Intellect | 83 | 5 | Arcane — forbidden with Runecraft |
| **Ki** | Physique | 37 | 5 | Internal energy mastery |
| **Runecraft** | Agility (craft) | 32 runes | 5 | Physical craft — see combination rules below |

### Spell Scaling Rules (canonical — never deviate)
| TN Range | AP Cost | Max Damage Dice |
|---|---|---|
| TN 1–3 | 1 AP | Dis.d10 |
| TN 4–6 | 1 AP | 1d10 |
| TN 7–9 | 2 AP | 2d10 |
| TN 10–12 | 3 AP | 3d10 |
| TN 13–15 | 4 AP | 4d10 |
| TN 16–18 | 5 AP | 5d10 |
| TN 19+ | 6 AP | 6d10 |

### Resist Test Format (always use this exact format)
> `surpass [Stat] TN X + Resist bonus`

Never write "pass a Willpower test" — always include the TN number.

### Runecraft Combination Rules
| Discipline | With Runecraft | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Faith | ✔ Allowed | Divine scripture carved into blessed steel |
| Shaman | ✔ Allowed | Ancestral runes — needs cultural justification from player |
| Ki | ✔ Allowed | Internal discipline + external inscription |
| Wizardry | ✘ **Forbidden** | Opposed philosophies of what magic IS — absolute, no GM override |
| Druid | ✘ **Forbidden** | Static binding vs living flow — absolute, no GM override |

### Runecraft AP Scale (does NOT use standard spell table)
| Type | AP Cost | When |
|---|---|---|
| Temporary — Simple | 1 AP | In combat |
| Temporary — Standard | 2 AP | In combat |
| Temporary — Powerful | 3 AP | In combat |
| Permanent — Standard | 2–3 days | Outside combat only |
| Permanent — Master | 4 days | Outside combat only — cannot be rushed |

