## Design Decisions — Do Not Undo

These are deliberate decisions made after discussion. Do not revert them:

| Decision | Detail |
|---|---|
| Wizardry + Runecraft | Hard forbidden — no GM override ever |
| 6 skills per characteristic | Hard rule — never add a 7th |
| Enraged removed | Moved to Battle-Ready/Berserker Advanced Mastery |
| Counter → Riposte | Renamed AND moved from Agility to Awareness |
| Light-Soul no prereq | Faith(1) requirement deliberately removed |
| Shieldsman stays in Physique | Considered Advanced, kept as primary |
| Druid + Runecraft forbidden | Static binding vs living flow |
| Theology not Religion | Display name only — internal JS still uses "Religion" |
| Hard as Nails spell WM | Starts at 3pts, same floor(pts/2) formula as physical |
| Tumble racial costs | Halfling 15, Elf 20, Human 25, Dwarf 30 |

